GENEVIÈVE GAGNON, v.p. de Gagnon

00:00:07.541 --> 00:00:10.577 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La grande Quincaillerie

00:00:08.642 --> 00:00:11.712 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La fameuse pénurie de main-

00:00:09.777 --> 00:00:12.813 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'oeuvre dont tout le monde

00:00:10.878 --> 00:00:13.914 size:53% position:73% line:53%
parle, c'est notre plus grand

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:15.015 size:53% position:73% line:53%
enjeu. Je dirais qu'à travers

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:16.150 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nos 100 succursales, il nous

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:17.251 size:53% position:73% line:53%
manque environ une cinquantaine

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:18.352 size:53% position:73% line:53%
